;
; RT24 / PT24 (#709), ADR 0047 and PT23/PT24 as updated by PR #836.
; Expectations come from independent arithmetic or stored AutoCAD blocks.
; No Tecnigrafo executable was used to derive these values.

; Hidden text and DIMCEN=0 isolate the radius line and arrow orientation.
; R=50 is safely outside the small-circle cases that override the formulas.

Inside = DIMENSION kind=radius style="ISO-25" center=0,0 point=50,0 text-point=20,0 measurement=0 text=" " user-text-position=yes overrides=DIMCEN:0
? distance Inside 48.75,0.05 -> 0
? crosses Inside 50.9,0.02 51.1,0.03 -> no

Outside = DIMENSION kind=radius style="ISO-25" center=0,0 point=50,0 text-point=80,0 measurement=0 text=" " user-text-position=yes overrides=DIMCEN:0
? distance Outside 51.25,0.05 -> 0
? crosses Outside 19.9,0.02 20.1,0.03 -> no

OnCurve = DIMENSION kind=radius style="ISO-25" center=0,0 point=50,0 text-point=50,0 measurement=0 text=" " user-text-position=yes overrides=DIMCEN:0
? distance OnCurve 48.75,0.05 -> 0
? crosses OnCurve 50.9,0.02 51.1,0.03 -> no

; Text at the center is invalid; a zero radius is not a dimension.
? grip Inside 20,0 0,0 -> invalid
? grip Inside 50,0 0,0 -> invalid
